          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బలహీనత — balahīnata — \"frailty; weakness\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "జ్వరం తరువాత కొన్ని రోజులు బలహీనత ఉంటుంది. jvaraṁ taruvāta konni rōjulu balahīnata uṇṭundi. After a fever there is weakness for a few days."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బలహీనంగా, weak; బలం, strength, + హీన, lacking."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బలహీనత (balahīnata) is a learned compound built from Sanskrit bala, \"strength\" (CDIAL 9161), and hīna, \"lacking\" (Monier-Williams), with the abstract ending -త."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
